Circuit validation: the hand-written rules from docs/CircuitModel.md.

Semantic validation only, for fast editor feedback. Runtime *shape*
validation is deliberately absent -- ADR-0005 section 6 defers it to
Milestone 3, when the frontend first reads a circuit it did not build.

Violation codes come from ../model/spec.ts, which is generated. Never
hand-write a code string here.

Mirrors backend/src/phasor_workbench/validation/. Empty until Milestone 2.
